      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عكّس</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَعْكِيسٌ</span>, [<i>He said the contrary
of what he meant; spoke ironically.</i>] (A and
Mgh in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حرس</span>. [In the former, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تعكيس</span> is
coupled with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَهَكُّمٌ</span>, which signifies the same.])

